 companion (decision 0042). Frozen model values: docs/research/t5109-fresh-predictions.json. Predictions are hypotheses, NOT expected values. Precision!B2:B4 must retain 0.9999999999999998, 1, 1.0000000000000002; C2:C4 must be -1,0,1.",
